  "description": "Get ready for North American Dota Challengers League (NADCL) Season 8, the premier NA Dota 2 league for rising talent, running from May 18 to May 30, 2025! Hosted online, this season features the Players Combine (May 18-24), Player Draft Auction (May 26), and Main Event (May 28-30), with a prize pool of up to $4,000 USD. Founded by PPD, NADCL Season 8 offers aspiring pros a platform to shine, with team owners pre-selecting players and a 25% prize pool share for owners. Join the community on Discord for a new IHL play submission round, raffles, giveaways, and more. Details below!",
